// # Master Robotics, ROS2, Kinematics, Dynamics & Motion Control Facade
//
// Logline: Unified master facade re-exporting all 49 robotics, ROS2 DDS, kinematics, dynamics, trajectory planning, collision, control, and SLAM submodules.
//
// Setup: Single-entry import shim and unified factory API for openOODA robotics applications.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Import 49 modular ROS2 middleware, TF2 geometry, kinematics, multi-body dynamics, trajectory, collision, control, and SLAM submodules.
//   2. Define Unified Robotics Node & Controller Configuration descriptors.
//   3. Re-export public convenience constructors for publishers, kinematics chains, trajectory planners, and controllers.
//   4. Maintain full backwards compatibility and uniform type access across the openOODA robotics suite.

